  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Volunteering for Community Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar is a country facing many different crises and with lack of social cohesion in the communities. Youth in Myanmar lead challenging lives with lack of access to quality education and youth friendly spaces. Youth Volunteering for Community Action is a project giving youth in Myanmar the tools to be positive change agents in their communities. Through this pilot project, Myanmar Red Cross Society and Danish Red Cross Youth want to build the knowledge and skills for youth in Myanmar. This will be done, as young volunteers from Myanmar Red Cross Society are trained and will facilitate sessions for youth in their communities. The youth will then implement micro-projects with youth activities in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
